<title>SPAIN: Repsol roadshow calendar for share offer.</title>
<headline>Repsol roadshow calendar for share offer.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy group Repsol detailed on Wednesday its roadshow calendar for the presentation of its last public share offering to financial institutions:</p>
<p>APRIL 10: Barcelona stock exhange</p>
<p>APRIL 11: Bilbao, Valencia stock exchange</p>
<p>APRIL 14: Frankfurt, Milan</p>
<p>APRIL 15-18: Amsterdam, Rotterdam, The Hague, Dublin, Edinburgh, Glasgow, Geneva, Zurich, Paris, London.</p>
<p>APRIL 21: US - New York, Boston, Philadelphia, Baltimore, Minneapolis, Chicago, Kansas City, Denver, San Francisco, Los Angeles.</p>
<p>The offer of up to 30 million shares, representing the Spanish government's last 10.0 percent stake in the energy firm, started the period for provisional subscriptions on the Spanish retail tranche on Monday.</p>
<p>The insitutional book-building period starts on April 14.</p>
<p>The final offer price will be fixed on April 28, and the shares will start trade the following day.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
